@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Home";
}

<div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-heading">
        <h2>Legacy Order Management Portal</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body">
        <p>This portal is a legacy on-prem application used by operations teams to manage orders, customers, products, and reporting.</p>
        <p>It is built with ASP.NET MVC 5, Entity Framework 6 Code First, and uses SQL Server LocalDB for persistence.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Orders management with simple CRUD</li>
            <li>Customer and product lookup pages</li>
            <li>File logging and Web.config-based settings</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Use the menu above to explore orders, customers, and products.</p>
    </div>
</div>
